<title>SINGAPORE: SIMEX's Sam to be OCBC deputy president.</title>
<headline>SIMEX's Sam to be OCBC deputy president.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oversea-Chinese Banking Corp Ltd said on Wednesday Elizabeth Sam would be appointed its deputy president and a director with effect from October 3.</p>
<p>Sam is currently the deputy chairman of the Singapore International Monetary Exchange (SIMEX) and chairman of SIMEX's Executive Committee.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
